{"id":"662045","name":"牛肉焖饭","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/662045/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"牛肉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"洋葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香菇","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香米","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"牛肉洗净切薄片。","img":"images/662045/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加入玉米淀粉，老抽，蚝油抓拌均匀。","img":"images/662045/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加入适量花生油抓匀锁住水份。","img":"images/662045/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"香菇提前泡发切细。","img":"images/662045/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"胡萝卜去皮洗净切细。","img":"images/662045/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"洋葱洗净切细备用。","img":"images/662045/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"大米淘洗干净后加入平时煮饭的水量即可。","img":"images/662045/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"电饭锅先煮米饭。","img":"images/662045/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"锅中热油放入牛肉，炒至七八成熟后盛出。","img":"images/662045/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"热油放入洋葱碎，翻炒炒至焦黄后盛出。","img":"images/662045/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"热油放入香菇炒出香味。","img":"images/662045/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"放入胡萝卜翻炒。","img":"images/662045/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"适量蚝油，盐调味炒匀。","img":"images/662045/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"米饭煲至水干，但还没熟。","img":"images/662045/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"将炒过的香菇和胡萝卜放入电饭锅里。","img":"images/662045/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"放入牛肉，焖至米饭熟。","img":"images/662045/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"出锅前放入炒过的洋葱。","img":"images/662045/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"翻拌均匀即可。","img":"images/662045/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/662045/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/662045/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/662045/step_21.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电饭煲、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}